⚠️ Possible Improvements

The main requirements are implemented, but there are a few things you could improve later.

1. Handle invalid menu input

Currently:

opt = int(input("Choose: "))

If the user types:

abc

the program will produce an error.

A future version could use try/except.

2. Make update name handling consistently lowercase

When adding and deleting, names are converted using .lower().

However, in the update option:

name = input("Enter the name to update: ")

the input is not converted to lowercase.

So entering:

Arun

instead of:

arun

may result in:

Name not found.

You could later use:

name = input("Enter the name to update: ").lower()
3. Validate phone/email/city

The current program accepts whatever text the user enters. Later, you could add validation for:

Phone number length
Digits in phone number
Basic email format
Empty names
Empty city

These are improvements for a future version, not missing core requirements.


